{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：恒地2026上半年业绩观察，核心利润增长66%</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。恒基地产公布<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>上半年业绩，账面净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41亿</span>港元，剔除约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10亿</span>港元公允价值损失后，核心利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51亿</span>港元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">66%</span>，明显高于市场和机构的预期。推动利润跳升的主要是两笔收入：农地收回带来<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16亿</span>港元税前收益，以及香港发展物业利润强劲入账，税前利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17亿</span>港元，而去年同期只有7000万港元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份研报的核心判断是，恒地盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">拐点</span>已经出现。经过几年调整，集团应占EBIT（含联营和合营企业）同比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">70亿</span>港元，主要靠香港发展物业收入确认翻了两倍，从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38亿</span>港元增至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">133亿</span>港元，利润率也从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.1%</span>修复到18.3%。简单说，过去几年香港楼盘入账少、利润薄，现在进入集中交付期，收入和利润率同时回升。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWkVMvib7GzYFlMniaRCMicrDeOhQNUANjDk4IIlHNkuStwgqQp0yHwPAou5JKVhNTmUM3Bofx3o3Oia1Pt9OENTTRZUrQnoMXMAus/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 香港住宅销售回暖，半年卖楼量已超去年全年</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">恒地上半年卖出2800个单位，合约销售额<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">181亿</span>港元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">188%</span>，已经超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>全年2600个单位的销量。研报指出，销售主要来自红磡One Victoria Cove、土瓜湾Highwood、红磡Chester和中半山The Legacy等项目，其中One Victoria Cove贡献约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">49亿</span>港元，售出约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层明确表示没有降价清库存的打算。截至6月底，恒地还有约4000个未售单位，可售面积<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">130万</span>平方英尺，同时手持现金约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">210亿</span>港元。研报认为，公司财务稳健，不需要靠降价回笼资金，并维持下半年发展物业利润率在十几厘水平的指引。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">181亿</span>港元合约销售这个数字，它比利润更能说明需求是否真实。简单说，恒地半年卖楼量超过去年全年，说明香港住宅市场从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>开始的回暖确实传导到了这家开发商；我更关注的是下半年推出的8个项目、1700个单位能否维持同样的去化速度，尤其是高端项目在资金管控收紧后的表现。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWczqM7MqYG4hg0IWqAibtjcxVBGzPtstuqmkC2umeg8AkZXHfAG0bz2703NfN36ov5LyGYO9ibrjmkGV5liacm4nRhKibNWSXPFAQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 中环写字楼租金<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>，内地物业仍在调整</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">租金收入方面，恒地整体物业研究EBIT同比微增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">34亿</span>港元。香港核心中环区域表现最好，租金同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，主要受惠于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40.8%</span>持股的IFC维持满租，写字楼和零售的现货租金都高于现有租金水平。中环美利道项目The Henderson出租率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">95%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">90%</span>，管理层解释是一层原本用于展览的楼层到期，计划分拆成4000至5000平方英尺的单位租给家族办公室。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">内地物业组合则继续<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">承压</span>，租金同比下跌<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>，写字楼供应过剩的问题没有缓解。这与研报覆盖的其他香港开发商观点一致，内地写字楼市场仍在调整期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXcCmlC3hBqHOPVicG8O5yWsacRZ7goIrfo9cpCx6QlgMeHLE1tQZWvkL2cf2TvnSnvgKzNwdoV6ibNSFher3rmEkoK2IaBoZ5lg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 派息维持稳定，净负债率继续<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">恒地中期息维持每股0.5港元不变，符合预期，相当于核心利润派息率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48%</span>，若扣除资本化利息则现金利润派息率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">68%</span>。研报预计全年总派息1.26港元，按当前报价计算股息率约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.5%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">公司净负债率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>底的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18.7%</span>进一步降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17.9%</span>，若计入母公司<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">77亿</span>港元股东贷款则为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41.6%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXSZHDbJCdckDl11nvgm8s8ibB6hREb4JqlksKQuHicSE9PSBYRx5zx9MbhxahvS2gwsAx0L05V1hfpQaA9SjR7ibar5Vma3GXB50/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 36-GS-Henderson Land -0012.HK- 1H26 results above on strong DP profit recovery and farmland resumption gain. No intention to cut prices to clear inventory-260821</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
